  "description": "Secondary: shift into a wolf at night, or any time your rage is at least 25; secondary again changes you back. Shifted you're faster and stronger with 3 more hearts, see in the dark, heal at night, jump higher, land softly and can smell living things (they glow red within 20 blocks). Claws work best bare: holding an item halves your damage, bare claws can make enemies bleed. You can't use items except to eat meat, you get hungry twice as fast, and rage drains 2 a second; at zero you change back.",
